 "stimulus_html": "<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/b7ed21c315a00086.png\" alt=\"An image shows a painting of people of different races and mixed races.\">\n<figcaption>An oil painting from 1777 entitled <i>Las castas mexicanas</i> (The Mexican Castes).</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the image provided.</i></p>",
 "questions": [
